  "post_title": "30 fotos de la primera sessió del FES Tales 2020, que tindrà una segona volta diumenge 8 de novembre",
  "post_date": "2020-10-11 17:54:29",
  "post_name": "30-fotos-de-la-primera-sessio-del-fes-tales-2020-que-tindra-una-segona-volta-diumenge-8-de-novembre",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/10/IMG_20201010_174605.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 359px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"12\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"13\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"15\">Aquest dissabte, 10 d&#39;octubre, ha comen&ccedil;at el FES Tales, que</span><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"14\"> tornar&agrave; en una nova sessi&oacute; diumenge 8 de novembre. Organitzat pel Centre Cultural Tales i patrocinat per l&#39;Ajuntament, la Diputaci&oacute; de Castell&oacute; i la Generalitat, est&agrave; dirigit novament per Pepa Cases.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/10/IMG_20201010_172335.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"9\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"10\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"11\">Guillermo Le&oacute;n, de M&egrave;xic, amb la pe&ccedil;a de circ &#39;&iquest;Qu&eacute; sombrero est&aacute; pasando?&#39; ha trencat el foc. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/10/IMG_20201010_182017.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"6\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"7\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"8\">Despr&eacute;s ha sigut el torn del duet Depaso i el circ aeri &#39;La Trottola&#39;. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/10/IMG_20201010_191959.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"3\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"4\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"5\">La clown Maria Andr&eacute;s ha presentat la pe&ccedil;a &#39;Fr&agrave;gil&#39;. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/10/JujaFesTales-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"2\">Per a finalitzar ha hagut esquetxos amb els valencianets Juja.</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festalesprimerdia2020/img_20201010_172328.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201010_172328\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festalesprimerdia2020/img_20201010_172332.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201010_172332\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festalesprimerdia2020/img_20201010_172335.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201010_172335\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festalesprimerdia2020/img_20201010_172350.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201010_172350\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festalesprimerdia2020/img_20201010_174533.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201010_174533\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festalesprimerdia2020/img_20201010_174547.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201010_174547\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festalesprimerdia2020/img_20201010_174605.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201010_174605\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"htt